# The image is built from these alone (Dockerfile): the Go module and its
# root package, the binary's sources, the skill it carries, the web app's
# sources, and the licence files it ships. Everything else (private notes,
# release output, the website, local data) never enters the build context.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!cmd
!internal
!integrations
!web
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES

# Inside those: what a local build left behind.
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
**/.DS_Store
**/*.sqlite*
